repository-code: "https://github.com/jaewansh/KMOU-A-mobility-informed-SIR-model"
abstract: "Research code and reproducibility materials for a mobility-informed SIR model using subway ridership data, particle smoothing, a negative binomial observation framework, and mobility-reduction scenarios to evaluate influenza transmission and the instantaneous reproduction number."
keywords:
  - human mobility
  - influenza
  - instantaneous reproduction number
  - mobility-informed SIR
  - particle smoothing
  - negative binomial observation model
  - subway ridership
  - mobility reduction scenarios
